Package: saguaro
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Saguaro DevOps <saguaro.devops@gmail.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: adduser
Recommends: postgresql, unbound, pdns-server, pdns-backend-pgsql, kea-dhcp4-server, kea-dhcp-ddns-server, nftables, nginx
Homepage: https://github.com/saguarogit-cmzk/SGSU
Description: Saguaro Network Appliance control plane
 Web GUI and API for managing the Saguaro DHCP/DNS appliance
 (Kea DHCP, Unbound, PowerDNS, nftables, PostgreSQL).
 The package ships the control-plane binary, systemd units and the
 backup job; system configuration is performed by the Saguaro
 installer (scripts/install-ubuntu.sh) or the GUI wizards.
